  "variation": {
    "seeded": true,
    "notes": "Every bat's path, size and flap timing change per cast, as do the blood flecks and the mark. The swarm always reaches the enemy at about 1.3 s."
  },
  "director_notes": "Vampire line, a bat swarm. Uses the new sparks look: bat (a flapping V silhouette in the layer colour with a faint rim). The outbound swarm is sparks home_to: target, so each bat bursts off the cloak and curves in to the enemy. Around the enemy, bats orbit a very faint vortex (opacity 0.18, mostly there to carry them) and are flung up when it dissipates. Bats are drawn alpha-blended in the palette's shadow colour so they read dark against a lit scene; on a black background, give them a lighter colour."
